    "encrypted": "false",
    "long_instructions": "# Debug & Validate Live Data\r\n\r\n**Goal:** Confirm your app is rendering real API data correctly and reliably.\r\n\r\n1. **Refresh and Retest:** Reload your app to confirm data still loads correctly.\r\n2. **Check for Undefined Values:** Scan your cards for missing text or broken images.\r\n3. **Log Individual Fields:** If something looks wrong, console.log specific properties to verify field names.\r\n4. **Verify It Is Live:** Change the endpoint parameter (if possible) or refresh to confirm the data updates.\r\n5. **Check Status Codes:** Use the Network tab to confirm successful responses.\r\n\r\n**Optional:** Temporarily break the endpoint URL and observe what happens. This will prepare you for adding proper error handling in the next milestone.",
